                                    "id": "394620bb-1b6d-4b26-a915-8a4a1367127e",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "The lantern shows\nSTEADY, and the\nwritten received\ncard is signed.",
                                        "The backup courier\nis named in the\nlog. Dot reads\nboth before",
                                        "declaring the\nsignal ready. Pip\nwaits for the\nwhole sentence,\nwhich",
                                        "she appreciates\nmore than he\nknows.",
                                        "The received\nlaunch card also\nconfirms the\nnormal service\nlimit is",
                                        "FOUR. The brief\ntest ceiling\nremains SIX; EIGHT\nremains a damage",
                                        "warning. Dot asks\nyou to carry that\nchecked value to\nthe final grid",
                                        "inspection, rather\nthan remembering\nthe largest number\non the old",
                                        "plate."
                                      ],
                                      "avatarId": "",
                                      "minHeight": 4,
                                      "maxHeight": 7,
                                      "position": "bottom",
